## Splunk Alert Configuration

The configured alert is:

**Alert Name:** `SOC - Possible Brute Force`

### Configuration

| Setting | Value |
|---|---|
| Schedule | Every 5 minutes |
| Time Range | Last 15 minutes |
| Trigger | Number of results > 0 |
| Action | n8n Webhook |

The Splunk alert sends the detected event to the n8n webhook.